{"text": "Self-Assessment Questionnaire\n\nThe following checklist is a self-administered, self-scored tool to assist you in determining your\nreadiness for distance learning course work.\n\nTo use the readiness checklist, simply answer \"Yes\" or \"No\" to each of the statements listed.\n(You may \"click\" the appropriate box with your computer mouse.) Be as honest with yourself as\nyou can, and decide for yourself if distance learning is for you!\n\nCc Cc 1. Tama self-motivated individual.\nYes No\nCc Cc 2. Iam able to work independently with little direction.\nYes No\nCc Cc 3. Lama self-starter.\nYes No\nCc Cc 4. lama good \"time-manager\".\nYes No\nCc Cc 5. Iam capable of self-discipline.\nYes No\nCc Cc 6. Iam an organized person---I can structure my time and surroundings.\nYes No\nCc Cc 7. Ihave good study habits.\nYes No\nCc Cc 8. Ican capably take notes from lectures, textbooks, or television programs.\nYes No\nCc Cc 9. Ican capably read for comprehension.\nYes No\nCc Cc 10. I can capably prepare and study for objective and subjective exams.\nYes No\nCc c 11. Iam comfortable asking questions in class when I need clarification.\nYes No\nCc c 12. Iam goal directed---if I set my sights on an end result, I usually achieve it.\nYes No\nCc Cc 13. Iam able to gather information visually.\n\nYes No",
